WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,460
unbelievable

2
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:07,820
What Jichuan did was more humane than Jidi

3
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:09,100
for limited resources

4
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:10,860
Ji Di, the superpower, does not accept the weak.

5
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,820
Only those with superpowers that are useful to Ji Di will be accepted

6
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:14,340
Real uncle

7
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:15,980
Without the help of Brother Jichuan

8
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:18,100
Xiaoxuan and her mother are dead

9
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,820
Brother Jichuan is a good person

10
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:22,040
Have something to eat

11
00:00:22,570 --> 00:00:24,970
My body is still very weak now

12
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:27,830
I'll do it myself

13
00:00:28,510 --> 00:00:30,350
I'll go get you some more food

14
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:32,410
I'm hungry so I can save some food.

15
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:34,700
Call me if you have anything

16
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:37,100
Xiaoxuan and I live in the room opposite you

17
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:38,820
You have a good rest

18
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:42,080
The people in this stronghold seem to be living a very artistic life.

19
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:44,040
Isn't Jichuan dangerous to humans?

20
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:45,640
I want to find Lai Jichuan and ask now.

21
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:48,390
I want to go back to the base and report the results of my investigation to the leader.

22
00:00:48,390 --> 00:00:49,710
But I can't exert any strength

23
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:52,490
I feel tired when I hold the evening mirror

24
00:00:52,490 --> 00:00:54,650
I can't even turn it on and get my phone back.
